  "fullContentHtml": "\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1 ast-no-date-box\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n\n<p><!-- .entry-header --></p>\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"post-desc\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Short Information :</strong><a href=\"https://bseh.org.in/home\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Board of School Education (BSEH), Haryana</span></a> </span>has recently released the Exam Date for the PRT, TGT, PGT Test on the official website of BSEH. Candidates Can Also Check All Details on Official <span style=\"color: #000000;\"></span>, Online applying process for Haryana HTET Online Form 2026 were accepted from 24 December 2025 to 05 January 2026. The examination is going to conducted on 04 &amp; 05 July 2026. Candidates must check the complete details for Haryana HTET Exam Date 2026 which has given below<span style=\"color: #000000;\">.</span></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-2\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable1\">\n<table style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Board of School Education (BSEH), Haryana</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\">Haryana HTET Exam Date 2026</span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Notification Date : <strong>24 December 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Application Start Date : <strong>24 December 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Last Date : <strong>05 January 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"background-color: #ffffff; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Fee Payment Last Date : <strong>05 January 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Correction Form : <strong>Notify Later</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Exam Date : <strong>04-05 July 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Admit Card :&nbsp;<strong>Before Exam</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Application Fee</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"background-color: #ffff00; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>For Level One</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">General, OBC, EWS : <strong>Rs. 1000/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Other State (Including SC &amp; PH) :&nbsp;<strong>Rs. 1000/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">SC, PH Candidates of Haryana :&nbsp;<strong>Rs. 500/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"background-color: #ffff00; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>For Level Two</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">General, OBC, EWS : <strong>Rs. 1800/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Other State (Including SC &amp; PH) :&nbsp;<strong>Rs. 1800/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">SC, PH Candidates of Haryana :&nbsp;<strong>Rs. 900/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"background-color: #ffff00; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>For Level Three</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">General, OBC, EWS :<strong>&nbsp;Rs. 2400/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Other State (Including SC &amp; PH) :&nbsp;<strong>Rs. 2400/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">SC, PH Candidates of Haryana :&nbsp;<strong>Rs. 1200/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Pay the Examination Fee Through Debit Card, Credit Card, Net Banking, E Challan</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n<p></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Age Limit</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">As per HTET Rules</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Use <span style=\"color: #000000; background-color: #ffff00;\"> </span>Tool – </span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Vacancy Details</strong></span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Total Posts : NA</strong></span></p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Level</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Level-I (Class 1-5)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Primary Teacher (PRT)</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Level-II (Class-6-8)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Trained Graduate Teacher (TGT)</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Level-III (Class 9-12)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Post Graduate Teacher (PGT)</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Educational Qualification</b></span></h3>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 30.8362%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 69.1638%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Qualification</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 30.8362%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Primary Teacher (PRT)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 69.1638%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates who have passed their Class 12<sup>th</sup>&nbsp;level of Examination with minimum 50% marks along with having/appearing 02 Years of Diploma in Elementary Education/04 Years of Bachelor of Elementary Education/Graduation Degree holders/appearing along with having Diploma in Elementary Education will be considered for this eligibility test.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 30.8362%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Trained Graduate Teacher (TGT)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 69.1638%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates having Graduation Degree/appearing in final year of 02 Years of Diploma in Elementary Education/Graduation Degree with minimum 50% marks &amp; having one year of B.ed Degree/ Candidates who have passed their Class 12<sup>th</sup>&nbsp;level of Examination with minimum 50% marks along with having/appeari9ng 02 Years of Diploma in Elementary Education will be considered for this eligibility test.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 30.8362%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Post Graduate Teacher (PGT)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 69.1638%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates having Masters Degree in English / Hindi / Physics / Chemistry / Maths / Economics / History / Geography / Commerce / Biology / Physics and other relevant subjects with minimum 50% marks &amp; Major Subject of Post Graduation must be a subject in Graduation and having B.Ed/M.Ed Degree with minimum 50% marks in aggregate;&nbsp; will be eligible for this post.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Mode of Selection</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Written Exam, </span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Document Verification</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>How To Download : Haryana HTET Exam Date 2026</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates must go to the&nbsp;<strong>Important Links</strong>&nbsp;section below</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Then the candidates must click on the&nbsp;<strong>Exam Date</strong>&nbsp;link.&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">After clicking on the link, the candidates will be redirected to a new page.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">In this page, candidates have to enter the following details:</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Registration no.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Login ID</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Birth Date/Password</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Captcha Code</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Then the candidates have to&nbsp; submit the details by clicking on the Login button.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">After successful login, candidates will be able to download the&nbsp;<strong>Exam Date.</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Alternatively, the candidates can download the&nbsp;<strong>Exam Date</strong>&nbsp;from the&nbsp;<strong>official website of HTET</strong>&nbsp;also.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n<p></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable2\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<table style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"4\" data-align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #cc0052;\"><strong>Follow SarkariExam on Instagram</strong></span></td>\n<td class=\"post-social-link\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"3\" data-align=\"center\"><strong></strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"text-align: center;\" colspan=\"4\" data-align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #cc0052;\"><b>Join Our WhatsApp Channel</b></span></td>\n<td class=\"post-social-link\" style=\"text-align: center;\" colspan=\"3\" data-align=\"center\"><strong><a href=\"https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VaAbQf01NCrYADMLt00L\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener n