/strong> by BSEH.</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-teams=\"true\"><strong>Q. When will the Haryana HTET 2026 exam be held?</strong><br>\n<strong>Answer.</strong> The Haryana HTET 2026 examination will be conducted on <strong>4-5 July 2026</strong>.</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Q. Where can I check the Haryana HTET Exam Date 2026?<br>\n</strong><strong>Answer.&nbsp;</strong>You can check it on the official BSEH website: https://bseh.org.in/home</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Q. What should I search on the website to find the Haryana HTET Exam Date 2026?<br>\n</strong><strong>Answer.</strong>&nbsp;Look for&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"731\" data-end=\"797\">“Exam Date – Haryana HTET Online Form 2025”</strong>&nbsp;in the notifications list</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Q. What login credentials do I need to download the Exam Date?<br>\n</strong><strong>Answer.&nbsp;</strong>Typically you will need your&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"1045\" data-end=\"1068\">Registration Number</strong>&nbsp;(or Roll Number)&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"1086\" data-end=\"1093\">and</strong>&nbsp;your&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"1099\" data-end=\"1116\">Date of Birth</strong>&nbsp;(or Password) to login.</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Q. How to download the result of Haryana HTET Result?<br>\nAnswer. </strong>All those candidates who had given the exam for this recruitment can now download their result. To download your result, you can download it by entering registration number / roll number and DOB (Date of Birth). The official download link of the result will be made available in the important links above.</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Q. What is Haryana HTET Official Website?<br>\n</strong><strong>Answer.&nbsp;</strong>The Official Website of Haryana HTET is https://bseh.org.in/home</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n",
